620 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 168 0 R
/E (Users rely on smooth interaction and clear feedback when working with large datasets. This goal focuses on evaluating how effectively the platform communicates progress \(e.g., when loading/exporting the data\) and how well it prevents or handles user errors. Effective feedback and error prevention mechanisms are essential for ensuring that users can work without unnecessary interruptions, enhancing their overall experience when analyzing global mortality trends.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
