<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 168 0 R
/E <FEFF0047006F0061006C0020002300200033003A0020004500760061006C007500610074006500200048006F00770020004500660066006500630074006900760065006C00790020007400680065002000570065006200730069007400650020005400610072006700650074007300200055007300650072007300270020004E0065006500640073002E00A0>
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
627 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 168 0 R
/E (The database serves a broad range of users, including public health researchers, health analysts, and academic researchers. This goal centers on assessing whether the platform offers features that cater to different user needs, such as advanced filtering options for various demographics \(like ages 35-54 in Canada and Japan for communicable diseases\) and customizable data visualizations. Understanding whether the platform meets these diverse requirements ensures it provides value to all users, enhancing their ability to make informed decisions based on the data.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
