3538 0 obj
<<
/Title (Identify the goals for conducting the usability evaluation: The purpose of this usability evaluation is to assess how effectively the WHO Mortality Database helps users achieve their objectives in exploring global mortality data. By identifying potential usability challenges and evaluating the platform's design, we aim to improve users' ability to gather, interpret, and analyze the data relevant to their research or decision-making needs. This evaluation will focus on ensuring that users can easily access, filter, and comprehend critical information without facing unnecessary obstacles.)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3527 0 R
